WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:10.700
Your team is putting AI agents into production. In the demo, the agent gets it right every time. Then real customers show up, and it starts getting things wrong, quietly.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:17.700
When it fails, which agent broke? The planner, the search, the tool call? Nobody can tell.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:25.200
And when the auditor asks how it was tested, there's nothing to hand over. Compliance is not happy.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:34.200
EvalTrust fixes all three, with independent testing and monitoring for your AI agents, before and after they ship. Here's how.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:45.200
It agrees on what good means first. Your team signs off on the rules (how accurate it must be, what's off limits) before any test runs. So no one moves the goalposts later.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:53.700
It tests on your real work. Real cases from your business, scored blind, so the number is honest. Not a demo score.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:01:03.700
It watches every step. In production, every agent's work is traced. When an answer goes wrong, you see exactly which step broke, and why.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:12.700
Before a new model or prompt goes live, it runs every check again and holds any change that would make answers worse.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:22.700
And you have the proof. One audit-ready report: what was tested, what passed, who signed off. Your data never leaves your cloud.

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:28.200
Honest tests. Clear view. Safe releases. Real proof.

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:35.700
Join the EvalTrust pilot: 4 weeks with one-to-one support. Start at app.evaltrust.cloud.
